      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-[#0F2D2D] mb-6">How to choose swim club software for your club</h2>
      <div class="space-y-6 text-ink-soft">
        <p>Choosing a swim club management system is a decision your committee will live with for years. Here is what matters most:</p>
        <div class="bg-surface-raised rounded-xl border border-[#39393A]/10 shadow-[0_1px_3px_rgba(57,57,58,0.08)] p-6 hover:shadow-[0_12px_32px_-12px_rgba(15,45,45,0.2)] transition-all">
