            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#0F2D2D] mb-2">1. Swimming club database management</h3>
              <p>Your membership database is the foundation. Look for family accounts (parents linked to swimmers), squad structures, medical notes, and easy CSV import from your current spreadsheet. Every platform above handles this differently.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-raised rounded-xl border border-[#39393A]/10 shadow-[0_1px_3px_rgba(57,57,58,0.08)] p-6 hover:shadow-[0_12px_32px_-12px_rgba(15,45,45,0.2)] transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#85FFC7]/20 border border-[#1F7A52]/15 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
              <CreditCard class="w-5 h-5 text-mint-ink" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#0F2D2D] mb-2">2. Payment and billing automation</h3>
              <p>If your Treasurer spends hours chasing swimming club payments via standing orders or bank transfers, automated Direct Debit collection is transformational. Only Swimly offers built-in GoCardless integration for UK clubs.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-raised rounded-xl border border-[#39393A]/10 shadow-[0_1px_3px_rgba(57,57,58,0.08)] p-6 hover:shadow-[0_12px_32px_-12px_rgba(15,45,45,0.2)] transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#85FFC7]/20 border border-[#1F7A52]/15 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
              <Shield class="w-5 h-5 text-mint-ink" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#0F2D2D] mb-2">3. UK compliance (Wavepower, DBS, GDPR)</h3>
